The game is finished.
We are tired but happy.
We sit near the court.
We drink water.
Amit says, "Maya, you play very well."
"Thank you!" I say.
"I like badminton a lot."
Neha asks, "Maya, can you play with us every week?"
I say, "Yes, I can play."
"But I can only come here on Thursday evenings," I say.
Sanjay laughs.
Sanjay says, "That is our time too."
"We also come to play every Thursday evening," Sanjay says.
I am very happy.
I like to meet new friends.
"Then I will come here every Thursday at half past five," I say.
Amit says, "Excellent!"
"We will play together."
We stand up again.
Now I go to return the racket.
